gmobile (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
    The actual library changes are fairly minimal (introducing two new symbols
    that nothing in Trixie will depend on) but the fact that upstream now ships
    the tests as installed tests makes this worthwhile for Trixie.
  * packaging: Install tests to examples
  * packaging: Add autopkgtest that runs the installed tests giving
    us non-superficial autopkgtests
  * Install vapi files
  * Add two new symbols

